      "refersTo": "review-button",
      "description": "Explicit shared Home and History entry to receipt editing.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-review\">Review <svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></button>",
      "css": ".ds-review{font-family:var(--font-body,Inter,sans-serif);font-size:14px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;min-width:88px;height:40px;padding:0 12px;border:1px solid var(--border,#E5E7EB);border-radius:10px;background:var(--card,#fff);color:var(--text,#1F2937);font-weight:500}.ds-review:hover{border-color:var(--primary,#22C55E)}.ds-review:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--primary,#22C55E);outline-offset:3px;}.ds-review:active{transform:scale(.97)}"
